+ * 32 has step m in every row (an even modulus keeps its step under
+ * --sieve-skip), and m == 1 has step 1, or 2 in a skipped even row; nth is a
+ * multiple of 32 and CPW >= 2, so 64 divides CPW*nth and every such step does. */
